								<p class="newsTitle">
									Welcome - 
									12/5/2004 1:40:00 PM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p class="storyline" style="MARGIN: auto 0in; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><strong><i><span style="FONT-SIZE: 36pt; COLOR: rgb(51,102,255); FONT-FAMILY: 'Lucida Blackletter'"><img src="/pics/1602/Sign.gif" />&nbsp;</span></i></strong></p> <p class="newstext" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><strong><span style="COLOR: rgb(51,102,255); FONT-FAMILY: 'Book Antiqua'"><font size="4"><em><span style="FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><font color="#000000"><font color="#0000ff" size="3">We are a family, taking all the bad along with the good. We may bicker, but<br />we're always there for each other. We treat one another with dignity and<br />respect. Our family grows stronger each time one of us succeeds.</font><br /><br /></font></span></em></font></span></strong></p> <p class="storysubtitle" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="justify"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: rgb(51,102,255); FONT-FAMILY: 'Book Antiqua'">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 24pt; COLOR: aquamarine; FONT-FAMILY: 'Bradley Hand ITC'">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="FONT-SIZE: 24pt; COLOR: aquamarine; FONT-FAMILY: 'Bradley Hand ITC'"><img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" /></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src="/pics/1602/ourgoals.jpg" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><span style="COLOR: rgb(51,102,255); FONT-FAMILY: 'Book Antiqua'"><font size="4"> <p class="newstext" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="justify"><br /><font color="#0000ff"><font size="2"><font face="Times New Roman"><strong>Moonlite Redeption was established for well seasoned players with the common and innate devotion to helping each other within our ranks. It is however encouraged that we help other players in Norrath, especially those with sincere need. We will enjoy EQ to the fullest with a devout sense of family ties within our guild. We have many individual and group goals, and we shall accomplish those goals as a team. Through questing, raiding, xp grouping, and flagging we will form a kinship that will be loved and honored by all who know us. We will uphold the rules of the land, touch the lives of many, and respect ourselves and others on our search for the righteousness that we will gain out of the battles we forge our friendships upon.</strong>&nbsp;<br /></p></font><ALIGN=RIGHT></font> <p align="right"><font size="2"><em>~Masterfu~</em></font></font></font><br /></font><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1782"><font size="2">Announcements to the Guild</font><br /></a> <p align="center"><strong><font size="4"><about font="" us=""><em><font color="#d3d3d3">About Us</font></em><br /></strong></font><font size="2"><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1555"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Our Creation<br />The Rathe Games</font></strong></a><br /><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1559"><strong><font color="#0000ff">The Hierachy</font></strong></a><br /><strong><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1600"><font color="#0000ff">Biographies</font></a><br /><a href="/gallery.aspx"><font color="#0000ff">Photo Album</font></a></strong><br /><br /></p></font></span> <p align="left"><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1601"><img src="/pics/1602/Fonts.gif" /></a></p>
								</div>
